          "snippet": {
            "line": 184,
            "text": "theorem angular_energy_moment (t : ℝ → ℝ) (a m ρ : ℝ) (ha : a ≠ 0)\n    (ht : Continuous t) (hmean : angularMean t = m)\n    (hvar : angularMean (fun θ => (t θ - m) ^ 2) = ρ / a) :\n    a * angularMean (fun θ => 1 + t θ ^ 2) = a * (1 + m ^ 2) + ρ"
